# Retrieval-index residue and internal audit notes.
#
# .project_index_manifest.json named a live Gemini File Search store and its
# 550 document ids. It was committed once, removed by hand in [RAG-5], and
# nothing stopped it coming back -- this does. The audit reports are working
# notes about this system's own weaknesses; they belong on the machine that
# wrote them, not in a public repository.
backend/.project_index_manifest.json
agent_rag_audit_report*.md
